usage: rebis.chain [-h] [--dna DNA] [--seq SEQ] [--target TARGET]
                   [--depth DEPTH] [--pdb PDB] [--file FILE] [--stdin]

UNIFIED PIPELINE: DNA→Protein→CatalyticSite→RetrosyntheticPlan

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --dna DNA             DNA/RNA sequence
  --seq SEQ             RNA sequence (alias for --dna)
  --target TARGET       Target SMILES (default: acetic acid)
  --depth DEPTH         Retrosynthesis depth (default: 2)
  --pdb PDB             Output PDB structure file for folded protein
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
